msgid "3.1.2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:3
msgid "SECURITY FIX: update `dot-prop` to `5.2.0`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:5
#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:23
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:7
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, due to fixing the vulnerability, the minimum supported "
"version of the Node.js is `8`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:9
msgid "3.1.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:11
msgid "Fix: typescript definitions weren't in the published package."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:13
msgid "3.1.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:15
msgid ""
"Fixed numerous bugs in attribute nodes relating to the handling of "
"comments and whitespace. There's significant changes to `attrNode.spaces`"
" and `attrNode.raws` since the `3.0.0` release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:17
msgid ""
"Added `Attribute#offsetOf(part)` to get the offset location of attribute "
"parts like `\"operator\"` and `\"value\"`. This is most often added to "
"`Attribute#sourceIndex` for error reporting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:21
msgid "3.0.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:25
msgid ""
"Some tweaks to the tokenizer/attribute selector parsing mean that "
"whitespace locations might be slightly different to the 2.x code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:27
msgid ""
"Better attribute selector parsing with more validation; postcss-selector-"
"parser no longer uses regular expressions to parse attribute selectors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:29
msgid ""
"Added an async API (thanks to @jacobp100); the default `process` API is "
"now async, and the sync API is now accessed through `processSync` "
"instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:31
msgid ""
"`process()` and `processSync()` now return a string instead of the "
"Processor instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:33
msgid "Tweaks handling of Less interpolation (thanks to @jwilsson)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:34
msgid "Removes support for Node 0.12."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:36
msgid "Other changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:38
msgid ""
"`ast()` and `astSync()` methods have been added to the `Processor`. These"
" return the `Root` node of the selectors after processing them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:40
msgid ""
"`transform()` and `transformSync()` methods have been added to the "
"`Processor`. These return the value returned by the processor callback "
"after processing the selectors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:43
msgid "Set the parent when inserting a node (thanks to @chriseppstein)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:44
msgid ""
"Correctly adjust indices when using insertBefore/insertAfter (thanks to "
"@tivac)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:45
msgid "Fixes handling of namespaces with qualified tag selectors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:46
msgid ""
"`process`, `ast` and `transform` (and their sync variants) now accept a "
"`postcss` rule node. When provided, better errors are generated and "
"selector processing is automatically set back to the rule selector "
"(unless the `updateSelector` option is set to `false`.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:49
msgid "Now more memory efficient when tokenizing selectors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:51
msgid "Upgrade hints"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:53
msgid "The pattern of:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:55
msgid "`rule.selector = processor.process(rule.selector).result.toString();`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:57
msgid "is now:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:59
msgid "`processor.processSync(rule)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:61
msgid "2.2.3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:63
msgid ""
"Resolves an issue where the parser would not reduce multiple spaces "
"between an ampersand and another simple selector in lossy mode (thanks to"
" @adam-26)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:66
msgid "2.2.2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:68
msgid ""
"No longer hangs on an unescaped semicolon; instead the parser will throw "
"an exception for these cases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:71
msgid "2.2.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:73
msgid ""
"Allows a consumer to specify whitespace tokens when creating a new Node "
"(thanks to @Semigradsky)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:76
msgid "2.2.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:78
msgid ""
"Added a new option to normalize whitespace when parsing the selector "
"string (thanks to @adam-26)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:81
msgid "2.1.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:83
msgid ""
"Better unquoted value handling within attribute selectors (thanks to "
"@evilebottnawi)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:86
msgid "2.1.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:88
msgid ""
"Added: Use string constants for all node types & expose them on the main "
"parser instance (thanks to @Aweary)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:91
msgid "# 2.0.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:93
msgid "This release contains the following breaking changes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:95
msgid ""
"Renamed all `eachInside` iterators to `walk`. For example, `eachTag` is "
"now `walkTags`, and `eachInside` is now `walk`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:97
msgid "Renamed `Node#removeSelf()` to `Node#remove()`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:98
msgid "Renamed `Container#remove()` to `Container#removeChild()`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:99
msgid "Renamed `Node#raw` to `Node#raws` (thanks to @davidtheclark)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:100
msgid "Now parses `&` as the *nesting* selector, rather than a *tag* selector."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:101
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Fixes misinterpretation of Sass interpolation (e.g. `#{foo}`) as an id "
"selector (thanks to @davidtheclark)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:104
msgid "and;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:106
msgid ""
"Fixes parsing of attribute selectors with equals signs in them (e.g. "
"`[data-attr=\"foo=bar\"]`) (thanks to @montmanu)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:108
msgid ""
"Adds `quoted` and `raw.unquoted` properties to attribute nodes (thanks to"
" @davidtheclark)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:111
msgid "1.3.3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:113
msgid ""
"Fixes an infinite loop on `)` and `]` tokens when they had no opening "
"pairs. Now postcss-selector-parser will throw when it encounters these "
"lone tokens."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:116
msgid "# 1.3.2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:118
msgid ""
"Now uses plain integers rather than `str.charCodeAt(0)` for compiled "
"builds."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:120
msgid "1.3.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:122
msgid "Update flatten to v1.x (thanks to @shinnn)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:124
msgid "1.3.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:126
msgid ""
"Adds a new node type, `String`, to fix a crash on selectors such as "
"`foo:bar(\"test\")`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:129
msgid "1.2.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-selector-parser_CHANGELOG.md:131
msgid "Fixes a crash when the parser encountered a trailing combinator."
